\b VPNTray\b0\par
\par
VPNTray is an internal utility that wraps the open-source openconnect client to connect to a Cisco AnyConnect-compatible VPN gateway, with built-in TOTP generation.\par
\par
This software bundles openconnect and the Wintun driver, which are distributed under their own open-source licenses (LGPL / GPL-compatible and the Wintun license, respectively). See the Resources folder after installation for details.\par
\par
The application installs per-machine and runs with administrator privileges, which openconnect requires to configure the virtual network adapter and system routes. Your VPN credentials are stored only in your own user profile and are never transmitted anywhere except to the VPN gateway you configure.\par
\par
By clicking Next you agree to use this software in accordance with your organization's policies.\par
